Package: armyknife
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: audio tag editor and MusicBrainz client for V\OS
 ArmyKnife tags audio files (ID3, Vorbis, FLAC and friends via TagLib),
 reads and writes the tag attributes of a folder of tracks, and resolves
 release data against MusicBrainz.
